  "description": "Engaged audio path based on the General Guitar Gadgets 2012 gray-version schematic. Includes the LM741, frequency-dependent gain and antiparallel silicon shunt clipping. Includes R1 and R12 from the source. The unused C5 footprint and the LED and footswitch are omitted. The op-amps use 2 V nominal headroom from both ends of the 9 V supply.",
  "io": {
    "groundNode": "0",
    "inputNode": "in",
    "outputNode": "out"
  },
  "layout": {
    "pots": [
      "Gain",
      "Level"
    ]
  },
  "name": "DOD 250 Overdrive Preamp Gray",
